{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/testing/folder-layout","title":"Folder layout organizer","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"folder-layout-organizer","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Folder layout organizer"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craft organize"},{"t":"text","text":" analyzes a fresh Craft dependency graph and proposes a folder"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"layout. It does not move files. The default placement follows route ownership"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and application-shell reachability; project-specific rules can add known"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"architectural constraints without changing those defaults for other projects."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"tune-an-organizer-run","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Tune an organizer run"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The programmatic entry point is "},{"t":"code","text":"organizeProject"},{"t":"text","text":", exported by"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools/folder-layout"},{"t":"text","text":":"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { organizeProject } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/dev-tools/folder-layout'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"organizeProject","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  project: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'apps/shop/tsconfig.graph.json'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  graph: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'craft-dependency-graph.json'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  out: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'apps/shop/folder-layout'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  weights: { calls: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"4","kind":"number"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  thresholds: { maxDepth: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"2","kind":"number"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  placementRules: [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      id: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'app-start-services'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      when: {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        nodeKind: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'service'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        nodeDetails: { appStart: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"true","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      scope: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      folder: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'core/app-start'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      reason: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Runs during application bootstrap.'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"weights"},{"t":"text","text":" adjusts the relative influence of graph relations. "},{"t":"code","text":"thresholds"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"controls the maximum proposed feature depth and the fan-in/fan-out values that"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"mark hubs. Omitted values keep their defaults."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"keep-project-rules-in-json","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Keep project rules in JSON"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The CLI accepts the same "},{"t":"code","text":"weights"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"thresholds"},{"t":"text","text":", and "},{"t":"code","text":"placementRules"},{"t":"text","text":" in a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"JSON file passed with "},{"t":"code","text":"--config"},{"t":"text","text":":"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"{","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"placementRules\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"\"id\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"app-start-services\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"\"when\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"\"nodeKind\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"service\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"\"nodeDetails\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"appStart\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"true","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"\"scope\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"core\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"\"folder\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"core/app-start\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"\"reason\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"Runs during application bootstrap.\"","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    }","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ]","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"json","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"craft","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"organize","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--project","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"apps/shop/tsconfig.graph.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--graph","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-dependency-graph.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--config","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"apps/shop/organizer.config.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--out","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"apps/shop/folder-layout","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The organizer evaluates rules in array order, before its default ownership"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"classification. A rule matches a file when at least one Craft graph node in"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"that file has the selected "},{"t":"code","text":"nodeKind"},{"t":"text","text":" and all selected "},{"t":"code","text":"nodeDetails"},{"t":"text","text":" values."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"The first matching rule sets the file's scope and destination. "},{"t":"code","text":"folder"},{"t":"text","text":" is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"relative to the organizer's target root, which defaults to the app's "},{"t":"code","text":"src/"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"folder when present."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Rules need a unique "},{"t":"code","text":"id"},{"t":"text","text":", a "},{"t":"code","text":"nodeKind"},{"t":"text","text":", optional "},{"t":"code","text":"nodeDetails"},{"t":"text","text":", a scope"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"("},{"t":"code","text":"feature-local"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"parent-shared"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"global-shared"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"core"},{"t":"text","text":", or "},{"t":"code","text":"unresolved"},{"t":"text","text":"), a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"safe relative "},{"t":"code","text":"folder"},{"t":"text","text":", and a human-readable "},{"t":"code","text":"reason"},{"t":"text","text":". In TypeScript,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"nodeKind"},{"t":"text","text":" narrows "},{"t":"code","text":"nodeDetails"},{"t":"text","text":"; for "},{"t":"code","text":"service"},{"t":"text","text":", keys and values are checked"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"against the service metadata ("},{"t":"code","text":"appStart"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"browserBoundary"},{"t":"text","text":" are booleans)."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"The JSON CLI validates known service detail keys and value types at runtime."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"The reason appears with the file's proposal. Resolved rules are written to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"folder-layout-analysis.json"},{"t":"text","text":" and contribute to the proposal's "},{"t":"code","text":"configHash"},{"t":"text","text":", so"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"changing policy produces a distinct review artifact. A matching explicit rule"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"has confidence "},{"t":"code","text":"1"},{"t":"text","text":"; destination collisions still require review."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"file-level-behavior","children":[{"t":"text","text":"File-level behavior"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The organizer proposes moves for whole files. If one service in a file matches"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a rule, the entire file receives that placement. Keep declarations with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"different folder policies in separate files. If several rules match a file,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the first rule wins; put narrower matchers first."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"demo-policy-app-start-services","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Demo policy: app-start services"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The dependency graph records "},{"t":"code","text":"appStart: true"},{"t":"text","text":" on Craft service nodes. The demo"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"uses that fact in "},{"t":"code","text":"apps/demo/organizer.config.json"},{"t":"text","text":" to place matching source"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"files under "},{"t":"code","text":"src/core/app-start/"},{"t":"text","text":". This policy is passed only by the demo's"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"attest:demo:folder-layout"},{"t":"text","text":" command, so it does not change the organizer's"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"defaults for other applications."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"To regenerate the proposal:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"run","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"attest:demo:folder-layout","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The command refreshes the read-only analysis and proposal artifacts. Apply a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"proposal separately with "},{"t":"code","text":"craft organize apply"},{"t":"text","text":" after reviewing it."}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"tune-an-organizer-run","text":"Tune an organizer run"},{"level":2,"id":"keep-project-rules-in-json","text":"Keep project rules in JSON"},{"level":3,"id":"file-level-behavior","text":"File-level behavior"},{"level":2,"id":"demo-policy-app-start-services","text":"Demo policy: app-start services"}]}